# The web app needs NO environment variables in this version (research pages only, no contract calls).
#
# Policy for anything added later:
#  - Only NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables may be set in the web app or on Vercel. They are embedded in the
#    browser bundle and are public by definition.
#  - Never put a private key, a deployer key, or an RPC URL that embeds an API key here.
#    Those live in the repo-root .env (git-ignored) and are used only by contracts/research tooling.
